{%- comment -%} ZeroStick homepage — transplanted from zerostickgaming.netlify.app (original work) {%- endcomment -%}

<!-- ── HERO SLIDESHOW ── -->
<section class="hero-slider">
  <div class="hero-slide active">
    <img src="{{ 'zs-hero-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" />
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h2>Built for Players Who Don't Settle</h2>
      <p>Modified controllers with TMR technology — upgraded for speed, precision, and zero drift.</p>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="btn btn-white">Shop Now</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-slide hero-slide--banner">
    <a href="/products/zerostick-pro-custom-tmr-hall-effect-joystick-module-compatible-with-ps5-dualsense-edge-tmr-drift-free-magnetic-stick-replacement-1x-high-precision-long-life-design" class="hero-banner-link" aria-label="Shop ZeroStick DualSense Edge Modules">
      {%- comment -%} Desktop gets the wide 12:5-ish banner; phones (<=767px) get the 2:3 portrait cut {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        WebP first, PNG fallback. The mobile PNG was 1.9MB and is the phone LCP;
        the WebP is 61KB with the same rounded-corner transparency. Explicit
        dimensions prevent layout shift, and fetchpriority beats the slider JS
        to the punch since this is the largest paint on the page.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 767px)" type="image/webp" srcset="{{ 'zs-banner-dse-mobile.webp' | asset_url }}">
        <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="{{ 'zs-banner-dse-mobile.png' | asset_url }}">
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ 'zs-banner-dse.webp' | asset_url }}">
        <img
          src="{{ 'zs-banner-dse.png' | asset_url }}"
          alt="ZeroStick TMR replacement stick modules for the PS5 DualSense Edge"
          width="1752" height="725"
          fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
      </picture>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-dots">
    <button class="hero-dot active" data-i="0"></button>
    <button class="hero-dot" data-i="1"></button>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} == MOBILE-ONLY HOMEPAGE (structure inspired by top controller stores, ZeroStick content) ==
