    <p>ZeroStick started in a garage and a mission. A kid sick of asking his
    parents for a new controller every time the sticks drifted. So we built the
    last controller you'll ever need: <strong>TMR technology installed on every
    model, out of the box.</strong></p>
  </section>

  <!-- M2. CONTROLLER DESIGNER (COMING SOON) -->
