    {%- comment -%}
      These three tiles used stock photos that contradicted their own labels:
      the PlayStation 4 tile showed a PS5 DualSense, Xbox Series X showed a
      DualSense too, and Xbox 360 / PC showed a PS3 SIXAXIS. For a company whose
      whole pitch is controller expertise, that is the worst possible detail to
      get wrong on the homepage.

      No correct Xbox or PS4 photography exists in the theme, and inventing it
      is not an option, so the tiles carry a neutral branded ground until real
      hardware shots exist. Add a matching image here when they do.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="m-designer-bar m-designer-bar--soon"><span>PlayStation 4</span><em>Coming Soon</em></div>
